BusyBox-RS Roadmap & TODO
========================

- [x] Phase 1: Core Applet Trait Architecture
  - Trait-based dispatcher with argv[0] / symlink resolution
  - Structured POSIX errors & raw OsStr / byte stream abstractions
  - Embedded profile (opt-level = "z", LTO, panic-abort, symbol stripping)

- [x] Phase 2: Core Filesystem & Text Processing
  - echo, true, false, pwd, printenv, sleep, yes, clear, reset
  - ls, cp (-a, -R, -d, -P, -H, -L, -p, -f), mv, rm, mkdir, rmdir, touch, link, unlink
  - cat, head, tail, wc, fold, rev, expand, unexpand
  - cut (full field, regex, byte, char, and delimiter support)
  - tr (sets, ranges, character classes, squeeze, complement)
  - uuencode, uudecode, xxd

- [ ] Phase 3: Advanced Stream & Filtration Engines
  - grep (-E, -F, -i, -v, -n, -c, -l, -L, -q, -o, -H, -h, -s)
  - sort (-n, -g, -k, -t, -r, -u, -o, -c, -s, -M, -z)
  - sed (stream editor script parsing & address matching)
  - awk (minimal pattern-action interpreter)
  - tar & cpio (pure-Rust archive extraction)

- [ ] Phase 4: Embedded Shell & Process Tree
  - sh: Lexer, recursive-descent parser, AST representation
  - Process pipelines, redirections (<, >, >>, 2>&1, pipes)
  - Job control, signals, subshells
  - init, halt, reboot, poweroff
